  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Foes go where you want them to.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Greater Drag<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> If you succeed at a drag combat maneuver, you can move a foe a distance up to your movement as part of the standard action to perform the maneuver, and are not limited to a straight line. If you expend a point of mythic power, there is no size limit to how big a foe you can drag for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc146\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
